'''Nixus Hub 218''' was a station on the [[black market]] [[planet]] [[Nixus]]. It was a base of operations for the [[smuggler]] [[Azmorigan]].<ref name="BotBH" /> The [[Galactic Empire]] had a presence on the station, and used this to capture two [[Lasat]].<ref name="LotL" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Nixus Hub 218 first appeared in "[[Brothers of the Broken Horn]]," an episode of ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''.<ref name="BotBH" />

